Blackdrift: replace the Focus-branded onboarding and search widget pictures.

Why: onboarding_second_screen_icon and focus_search_widget(_promote_dialog)
are raster pictures (WebP since Firefox 159, PNG before) of the Focus logo
and widget. patch -p1 cannot carry binary
files, so vector drawables are added in drawable-anydpi (and
drawable-night-anydpi for the dark-theme pictures). anydpi outranks the
upstream nodpi/hdpi WebP files, which stay in place unused. They show the Clean
Slate launcher tile and a widget pill in the brand colours. Verbatim copies of
blackdrift/branding/android/focus/res, generated by build.mjs.

Cut against: mozilla-firefox/firefox@6181e6b5f28a8fbae1d5c3ef6f6626b5a2180213 (Firefox 159.0.1).

